# Workflow Integration V1.5

**Bridge:** `src/utils/titanWorkflowIntegration.js`  
**Refresh:** `src/utils/titanWorkflowRefresh.js`

## 공식 흐름

```text
UI Action → executeStartCharging / executeFinishCharging
         → TitanWorkflowEngine → TitanDataEngine → Store
         → Legacy productionRecords Bridge (점진적)
         → notifyWorkflowDataRefresh → HOME · MES · Charging UI
```

## 개발 원칙

- 새 Service / SessionStorage 직접 접근 ❌
- TitanWorkflowEngine · TitanDataEngine · Store 재사용 ⭕
- UI / CSS / Router / Launcher / Breadcrumb 변경 ❌
- `equipmentWorkflowService` · `productionRecords` 즉시 삭제 ❌

## Verify

```bash
npm run verify:workflow-integration
npm run verify:workflow-engine
npm run build
```
